#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:4
msgid "Zero-downtime upgrades (Experimental)"
msgstr "Actualizaciones sin interrupciones (Experimental)"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:8
msgid ""
"Upgrade one component at a time while inference continues. Choose the component whose "
"code or environment needs changing; replacing a control process keeps existing model "
"processes and their loaded weights running."
msgstr ""
"Actualice un componente a la vez mientras la inferencia continúa. Elija el componente "
"cuyo código o entorno deba cambiar; al sustituir un proceso de control, los procesos "
"de modelo existentes y sus pesos cargados siguen funcionando."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:11
msgid "Prepare an upgrade"
msgstr "Preparar una actualización"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:13
msgid ""
"The running deployment must already support the relevant replacement protocol and "
"service host. API, Supervisor and Worker replacement support distributed deployments "
"on Linux and macOS, not local mode or Windows. Model-engine replacement has the Linux "
"GPU requirements described below."
msgstr ""
"El despliegue en ejecución ya debe admitir el protocolo de sustitución y el proceso "
"anfitrión del servicio correspondientes. La sustitución de API, Supervisor y Worker "
"admite despliegues distribuidos en Linux y macOS, pero no el modo local ni Windows. La"
" sustitución del motor del modelo tiene los requisitos de GPU Linux indicados más "
"adelante."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:15
msgid ""
"Install a compatible Xinference version and its dependencies in a separate environment"
" first. ``python_executable`` is an absolute Python path on the Supervisor machine for"
" API/Supervisor upgrades, or on the Worker machine for Worker/model upgrades. Packages"
" are not installed by these operations. Omit the path to reuse the current "
"environment. Use an administrator session when authentication is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Instale primero una versión compatible de Xinference y sus dependencias en un entorno "
"separado. ``python_executable`` es una ruta absoluta de Python en la máquina del "
"Supervisor para actualizar API/Supervisor, o en la máquina del Worker para actualizar "
"Worker/modelos. Estas operaciones no instalan paquetes. Omita la ruta para reutilizar "
"el entorno actual. Utilice una sesión de administrador si la autenticación está "
"activada."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:18
msgid "API and Web UI"
msgstr "API y Web UI"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:20
msgid "In **Cluster Information**, choose **Restart / upgrade API**, or run:"
msgstr "En **Cluster Information**, elija **Restart / upgrade API** o ejecute:"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:27
msgid ""
"The public HTTP address stays the same. New connections use the replacement API; "
"existing requests and streams finish on the previous API. The Supervisor, Workers and "
"models keep running. Refresh the browser to load the upgraded Web UI. See "
":doc:`api_relaunch`."
msgstr ""
"La dirección HTTP pública se mantiene. Las nuevas conexiones utilizan la API de "
"reemplazo; las solicitudes y los flujos existentes terminan en la API anterior. El "
"Supervisor, los Workers y los modelos siguen funcionando. Recargue el navegador para "
"cargar la Web UI actualizada. Consulte :doc:`api_relaunch`."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:30
msgid "Supervisor"
msgstr "Supervisor"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:32
msgid "In **Cluster Information**, choose **Restart / upgrade Supervisor**, or run:"
msgstr "En **Cluster Information**, elija **Restart / upgrade Supervisor** o ejecute:"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:39
msgid ""
"The API, Workers and models keep running, and public addresses stay the same. "
"Inference routes remain available while management operations briefly wait during "
"state transfer. Finish active model launches, downloads, reloads and Worker handoffs "
"before upgrading. See :doc:`supervisor_relaunch`."
msgstr ""
"La API, los Workers y los modelos siguen funcionando, y las direcciones públicas se "
"mantienen. Las rutas de inferencia siguen disponibles mientras las operaciones de "
"gestión esperan brevemente durante la transferencia de estado. Antes de actualizar, "
"termine los inicios, las descargas y las recargas de modelos y los traspasos de Worker"
" en curso. Consulte :doc:`supervisor_relaunch`."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:42
msgid "Worker"
msgstr "Worker"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:44
msgid ""
"In **Cluster Information**, choose **Restart / upgrade Worker** on the Worker to "
"upgrade, or use its current actor address:"
msgstr ""
"En **Cluster Information**, elija **Restart / upgrade Worker** en el Worker que desea "
"actualizar, o utilice su dirección actual de actor:"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:58
msgid ""
"The Worker starts its replacement and transfers model ownership automatically. Model "
"processes, their code and GPU weights stay in place; this does not upgrade the model "
"engine. Both environments need Xoscar 0.12.1 or later and compatible handoff support. "
"Multi-Worker models and Xavier/P/D deployments are unsupported. See "
":doc:`worker_handoff`."
msgstr ""
"El Worker inicia automáticamente su reemplazo y transfiere la responsabilidad de los "
"modelos. Los procesos de modelo, su código y los pesos de GPU permanecen intactos; "
"esto no actualiza el motor del modelo. Ambos entornos necesitan Xoscar 0.12.1 o "
"posterior y soporte de traspaso compatible. No se admiten modelos repartidos entre "
"Workers ni despliegues Xavier/P/D. Consulte :doc:`worker_handoff`."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:61
msgid "Model and engine"
msgstr "Modelo y motor"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:63
msgid ""
"Open a running model's detail view and choose **Reconfigure / upgrade model**. Engine "
"replacement requires **Keep GPU weights for reload** (``enable_weight_cache=true``) at"
" launch, vLLM 0.31.0+ or SGLang 0.5.21+, Linux with CUDA or ROCm, one Worker, one "
"replica and fixed tensor parallelism. To select a prepared model environment:"
msgstr ""
"Abra los detalles de un modelo en ejecución y elija **Reconfigure / upgrade model**. "
"Para sustituir el motor se requiere activar **Keep GPU weights for reload** "
"(``enable_weight_cache=true``) al iniciar, vLLM 0.31.0+ o SGLang 0.5.21+, Linux con "
"CUDA o ROCm, un Worker, una réplica y paralelismo tensorial fijo. Para seleccionar un "
"entorno de modelo preparado:"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:75
msgid ""
"The current engine serves until its replacement is healthy, then existing requests "
"finish on the old engine. Compatible engine and PyTorch versions can share retained "
"weights, but each engine needs its own KV cache and CUDA graphs. Reserve extra GPU "
"memory; incompatible versions also need a separate weight cache. Insufficient memory "
"rejects the upgrade while the current engine keeps serving. See "
":ref:`launch_weight_cache_reload` for supported changes and limitations."
msgstr ""
"El motor actual atiende solicitudes hasta que su reemplazo supera la comprobación de "
"estado; después, las solicitudes existentes terminan en el motor anterior. Las "
"versiones compatibles del motor y de PyTorch pueden compartir los pesos conservados, "
"pero cada motor necesita su propia caché KV y sus propios grafos CUDA. Reserve memoria"
" GPU adicional; las versiones incompatibles también necesitan una caché de pesos "
"separada. Si no hay memoria suficiente, se rechaza la actualización y el motor actual "
"continúa atendiendo solicitudes. Consulte los cambios admitidos y las limitaciones en "
":ref:`launch_weight_cache_reload`."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:78
msgid "Progress and recovery"
msgstr "Progreso y recuperación"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:80
msgid ""
"Submission returns HTTP 202 and an ``operation_id``; acceptance does not mean "
"completion. Follow progress in the Web UI or the component's status API. API, "
"Supervisor and Worker operations finish with ``succeeded`` or ``failed``; model reload"
" finishes with ``ready`` or ``error``. API ``draining`` means the replacement is "
"serving while previous requests finish."
msgstr ""
"El envío devuelve HTTP 202 y un ``operation_id``; la aceptación no significa que haya "
"terminado. Siga el progreso en la Web UI o en la API de estado del componente. Las "
"operaciones de API, Supervisor y Worker terminan con ``succeeded`` o ``failed``; la "
"recarga del modelo termina con ``ready`` o ``error``. El estado ``draining`` de la API"
" indica que el reemplazo está atendiendo solicitudes mientras terminan las anteriores."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:82
msgid ""
"Reuse the same ``request_id`` when retrying an API, Supervisor or Worker submission. "
"If a Worker operation is ``pending``, keep both processes alive and continue polling: "
"ownership transfer is uncertain. Failed preparation keeps the previous component "
"serving; for model errors, ``restored=true`` confirms the previous engine is serving."
msgstr ""
"Reutilice el mismo ``request_id`` al reintentar un envío de API, Supervisor o Worker. "
"Si una operación de Worker está en ``pending``, mantenga ambos procesos activos y siga"
" consultando: el resultado del traspaso de responsabilidad es incierto. Si falla la "
"preparación, el componente anterior sigue atendiendo solicitudes; en errores del "
"modelo, ``restored=true`` confirma que el motor anterior está atendiendo solicitudes."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:85
msgid "Upgrade boundaries"
msgstr "Alcance de la actualización"

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:87
msgid ""
"Keep service hosts and containers running throughout an upgrade. Stopping them also "
"stops retained processes and releases GPU allocations. Supervisor support actors "
"retain their original environments. Updating these hosts, retained support actors or "
"database schemas requires a planned restart; these operations do not upgrade an entire"
" installation at once."
msgstr ""
"Mantenga en ejecución los procesos anfitriones del servicio y los contenedores durante"
" toda la actualización. Detenerlos también termina los procesos conservados y libera "
"las asignaciones de GPU. Los actores auxiliares del Supervisor mantienen sus entornos "
"originales. Actualizar estos anfitriones, los actores auxiliares conservados o los "
"esquemas de base de datos requiere un reinicio planificado; estas operaciones no "
"actualizan toda la instalación a la vez."

#: ../source/user_guide/zero_downtime_upgrade.rst:90
msgid "Component reference"
msgstr "Referencia de componentes"
